{"id":"n73623-4-7","stage":4,"title":"잘다 · 小气","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n73623-4-7-1","ko":"너 저번에 만났던 사람은 어땠어?","zh":"你上次见的那个人怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}},{"text":"저번에","meaning":"那次","explanation":"저번：那次；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"저번","audio":"/audio/cfbadf011c981e92e9cc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71227","senseId":"1","lemma":"저번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저번에","audio":"/audio/e5add28f76ad4e4a4fb2.mp3"}},{"text":"만났던","meaning":"见面，相逢","explanation":"만나다：见面，相逢；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；던：修饰后面的名词，回想过去持续、反复或尚未完成的情况。","readings":[{"term":"만나다","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66591","senseId":"2","lemma":"만나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"만났던","audio":"/audio/8a2b1c881038bc3ca4a6.mp3"}},{"text":"사람은","meaning":"人、那个人","explanation":"사람：人、那个人；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"1","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사람은","audio":"/audio/987448c10afe56108009.mp3"}},{"text":"어땠어?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어땠어","audio":"/audio/fd7f0c90fa72bdb46939.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"cfbadf011c981e92","term":"저번","zh":"那次","audio":"/audio/cfbadf011c981e92e9cc.mp3","entryId":"71227","definition":"说话时刻之前已经过去的顺序或时间。","pronunciation":["저ː번"]},{"id":"b1bced847edb7e2e","term":"만나다","zh":"见面，相逢","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3","entryId":"66591","definition":"其中一人来或去，二人因而相见。","pronunciation":["만나다"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人、那个人","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"人、那个人","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/e4f31339bc64926043f2.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n73623-4-7-2","ko":"글쎄, 사람이 잘아서 좀 답답하더라.","zh":"怎么说呢，人挺小气，格局小，让人觉得憋闷。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"글쎄,","meaning":"也许吧，或许吧，难说","explanation":"글쎄：也许吧，或许吧，难说。","readings":[{"term":"글쎄","audio":"/audio/7ca52d3e5ceed208124e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29723","senseId":"1","lemma":"글쎄","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"글쎄","audio":"/audio/7ca52d3e5ceed208124e.mp3"}},{"text":"사람이","meaning":"为人，人品","explanation":"사람：为人，人品；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"4","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사람이","audio":"/audio/3f33d9d6ca9be288c4e3.mp3"}},{"text":"잘아서","meaning":"小气","explanation":"잘다：小气；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"잘다","audio":"/audio/4fafeaa3f439055abb3c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73623","senseId":"4","lemma":"잘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘아서","audio":"/audio/c95c2fc8a96b81768f52.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一点点，有一点","explanation":"좀：一点点，有一点。","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"1","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chi